2025-09-17 11:37:04,552 - MCPClient - INFO - Calling tool: get_sql_response with args: {'sql_query': "WITH temp_unnested AS (\n  SELECT \n    platform_number, \n    unnest(string_to_array(replace(replace(temp, '[', ''), ']', ''), ', ')::numeric) AS temperature\n  FROM argo_profile\n),\nmax_temps AS (\n  SELECT \n    platform_number, \n    MAX(temperature) AS max_temperature\n  FROM temp_unnested\n  GROUP BY platform_number\n  ORDER BY max_temperature DESC\n  LIMIT 10\n)\nSELECT \n  mt.platform_number, \n  mt.max_temperature AS highest_temperature,\n  ap.latitude,\n  ap.longitude\nFROM max_temps mt\nJOIN argo_profile ap ON mt.platform_number = ap.platform_number\nLIMIT 10;"}
